{"id":659,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"先端サイエンスと国際教育で探究力を育む六年間","feature_description":"高槻では中学２年まで全員がGLコースで基礎学力やグローバルリーダーを目指す価値観を育て、その後はGL・GS・GAの各コースで探究を深めます。理数探究、グローバル課題研究、英語教育を通じ、自らテーマを定めて研究し、考えを発信する力を養成。大学や研究機関と連携した先端的な学びも行っています。六年間のロードマップに沿って、中学から段階的に専門的な探究へ進みます。","clubs":[{"id":12327,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12328,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12329,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12330,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12331,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12332,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12333,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12334,"name":"アメリカンフットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12335,"name":"軟式野球部（中学）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12336,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12337,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12338,"name":"ワンダーフォーゲル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":12339,"name":"ダン